  "description": "Kick up some grit and swagger with Dodge City Dust! A rugged vintage Western font inspired by saloon signs, wanted posters, and dusty frontier towns. With bold slab serifs, weathered character, and just the right amount of grit, this font brings cowboy flair to any project.\nPerfect for Wild West party invites, cowboy-themed apparel, rodeo flyers, ranch branding, or vintage-style logos, Dodge City Dust is a rootin’-tootin’ typeface with attitude.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Kick up some grit and swagger with Dodge City Dust! A rugged vintage Western font inspired by saloon signs, wanted posters, and dusty frontier towns. With bold slab serifs, weathered character, and just the right amount of grit, this font brings cowboy flair to any project.</p>\n<p>Perfect for Wild West party invites, cowboy-themed apparel, rodeo flyers, ranch branding, or vintage-style logos, Dodge City Dust is a rootin’-tootin’ typeface with attitude.</p>",
